# IC102-D: the versions Tiny Tapeout's digital workflows use, and the ones we
# install.
#
# Read on 2026-11-15 and 2026-11-16 from the sources named on each line.
# install.sh, check-tools.sh and the run scripts all read this file, so a
# version changes in one place.
#
# When Tiny Tapeout moves the tag (a new shuttle tag in the template, or the
# same tag force-pushed to a new commit), read every value below again:
#   1. The template's .github/workflows/*.yaml and test/requirements.txt at
#      its new commit. Update TT_TEMPLATE_COMMIT, TT_ACTION_TAG, and the
#      cocotb and pytest pins.
#   2. `git ls-remote https://github.com/TinyTapeout/tt-gds-action refs/tags/<tag>`,
#      then action.yml and gl_test/action.yml at that commit, not at main:
#      the LibreLane default and gl_test's Icarus .deb (URL and sha256).
#   3. A fresh runner log of the test job: the runner image, the Python
#      version, the iverilog package version and the "Successfully installed"
#      line (for requirements.txt). And of a gds run's gl_test job:
#      PDK_VERSION, which is the PDK the gds job's LibreLane used.
#   4. make uninstall, make install, make install-gl, make check-tools,
#      make selftest.
#   5. Replace the pasted outputs in README.md and in the course pages.
#
# The digital template, and the action tag its workflows call:
#   TinyTapeout/ttsky-verilog-template a42e666, .github/workflows/*.yaml
TT_TEMPLATE=TinyTapeout/ttsky-verilog-template
TT_TEMPLATE_COMMIT=a42e6662fab316e93b4e26399e21d41664a460b7
TT_ACTION_TAG=ttsky26d
# What the tag pointed at when we read it (git ls-remote, 2026-11-15). Tags move.
TT_ACTION_COMMIT=395eedb3eeec3c2f4961c3b04ff2cf87f5525636

# The test job (test.yaml): runs-on ubuntu-24.04, `apt-get install iverilog`,
# setup-python '3.11', `pip install -r test/requirements.txt`.
# setup-python gave CPython 3.11.18 (uoftasic/hart-1 run 43752267378,
# 2026-11-15). The uv in the workbench (0.12.5) offers up to 3.11.16; the
# cocotb wheel is the cp311 build either way.
PYTHON_RUNNER=3.11.18
PYTHON_VERSION=3.11.16
COCOTB_VERSION=2.1.0
PYTEST_VERSION=8.4.2
# apt on the ubuntu-24.04 runner image 20261111.127.1: "Setting up iverilog
# (12.0-2build2)" (same run). This is that package, from the Ubuntu archive.
ICARUS_TEST_VERSION=12.0
ICARUS_TEST_DEB_URL=http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/universe/i/iverilog/iverilog_12.0-2build2_amd64.deb
ICARUS_TEST_DEB_SHA256=f19394cee05ad526e0eb3873bc6c17a5828f56df17fbe2db40cb66513a2d4667

# The gl_test job (gl_test/action.yml at ttsky26d): Tiny Tapeout's own
# Icarus 13.0 package, cocotb from test/requirements.txt, and the sky130A PDK
# at the commit the gds job's LibreLane used (pdk.json in tt_submission).
ICARUS_GL_VERSION=13.0
ICARUS_GL_DEB_URL=https://github.com/TinyTapeout/iverilog/releases/download/v13.0/iverilog_13.0-1_amd64.deb
ICARUS_GL_DEB_SHA256=888bca6b06289ea8b55368d43db38dc88932938319ab40d45a763ce5114e8505
# PDK_VERSION in gl_test (uoftasic/sentry run 43796948508, 2026-11-16):
SKY130_GL_PDK_COMMIT=8afc8346a57fe1ab7934ba5a6056ea8b43078e71

# The gds job (action.yml at ttsky26d). Not installed here; see README.md.
LIBRELANE_VERSION=3.0.14
# tt-support-tools at `main` on the day; this is what the runner checked out
# on 2026-11-16 (sentry run 43796948508).
TT_SUPPORT_TOOLS_COMMIT=9d13ff3e3e6202090740110438c6a10c1d62ca0f

# What the workbench image ships (hpretl/iic-osic-tools:2026.08), for the
# comparison column in check-tools.
WB_ICARUS=14.0
WB_COCOTB=2.0.1
WB_PYTHON=3.12.3
WB_LIBRELANE=3.1.0.dev3
